@TodoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062

### Health check
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### List everything (first page)
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### Most urgent open work first
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos?status=Pending&sortBy=Priority&descending=true
Accept: application/json

### High and Critical only
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos?minPriority=High
Accept: application/json

### Overdue items, soonest due date first
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos?isOverdue=true&sortBy=DueDate
Accept: application/json

### Free-text search with paging
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos?search=domain&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Create
# @name createTodo
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write integration tests",
  "description": "Cover the status and priority transitions.",
  "status": "Pending",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-30T17:00:00Z"
}

@todoId = {{createTodo.response.body.id}}

### Get one
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Accept: application/json

### Replace
PUT {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write integration tests",
  "description": "Cover filtering too.",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "priority": "Critical",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-02T17:00:00Z"
}

### Change status only
PATCH {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Change priority only
PATCH {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}/priority
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": "Low"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}

### Validation failure (empty title -> 400 with problem details)
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "High"
}
